msgid "The dense aetherial concentration of the Diadem seems to attract the deadliest of creatures. Needless to say, these oft-hostile denizens significantly impede our efforts to explore the isles.<br><br>Thus we turn to you─to battle-hardened adventurers─to cull their numbers. Make use of the traps provided, lure forth your prey, and slay without mercy.<br><br>Evaluation of your success will also hinge upon the extent of your explorations.<br><br>※Fill the evaluation gauge by participating in FATEs."
msgstr ""

#. ja: こちらアインハルト管制……<br>すべての探索任務の完了を確認した。
#. de: Hier Kontrollzentrale Haillenarte. Die Expedition zur Ungeheuerbeseitigung wurde erfolgreich abgeschlossen. Ich wiederhole: Expedition abgeschlossen.
#. fr: Ici le centre de commande de la maison Haillenarte.<br>Cibles vaincues, mission accomplie.
