#. column 23: That's far enough for a House Haillenarte agent to effect a safe retrieval.<br>Nicely done!
#. column 24: A fitting reward has been prepared in recognition of your efforts.
#. column 25: You are otherwise free to enter aetherial gaps, cross through the Grounding Gale, and explore the Diadem as you desire. The unknown awaits!
